-type="other">Sanderson LM, De Groot PJ, Hooiveld GJEJ, Koppen A, Kalkhoven E, M&#x000fc;ller M, Kersten S (2008) Effect of synthetic dietary triglycerides: a novel research paradigm for nutrigenomics. PLOS One, 3(2), art no e1681</citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>St-Onge</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Physiological effects of medium-chain triglycerides: potential agents in the prevention of obesity</article-title><source>J Nutr</source><year>2002</year><volume>132</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>332</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">St-Onge MP, Jones PJ (2002) Physiological effects of medium-chain triglycerides: potential agents in the prevention of obesity. J Nutr 132(3):329&#x02013;332 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11880549</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>